# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Happy Birthday|生日快乐
artist: Traditional|传统
bpm: 90
time: 3/4
level: 2
desc: A song in 3/4 time - count "1 2 3" in every bar. The first bar starts with two silent beats (a pickup), so you begin on beat 3.|三拍子 (3/4) 的歌, 每小节数 "1 2 3". 第一小节前面是两拍空拍 (弱起), 从第三拍开始弹.
desc: Tip: use your pinky for string 4 fret 4 (F#); the two notes of "Hap-py" are a long-short dotted rhythm.|小贴士: 4弦4品 (F#) 用小指; "祝你" 两个音是 "长-短" 的附点节奏.
